// The CFG form refines the structured form (docs/overview.md; the
// checker's `refines NAME LOW HIGH`, slc/cli/src/c1/gref.rs, on the rules
// of proofs/gimple_cfg.core), and a function's machine code implements its
// spec through the CFG: its C1 on the CFG form (proofs/mallocng_c1_cfg.core),
// the CFG form refining the structured one, the structured one's C2
// (proofs/mallocng_c2.core, proofs/mallocng_bits.core,
// proofs/mallocng_slots.core, proofs/mallocng_ctx.core), composed by
// tr.implements_refine.
//
// The loop-free functions, by cut points (g.cut_acyclic,
// proofs/gimple_cut.core); composed here those with a C2, a caller's CFG
// C1 linked with its callees' (on the CFG path alone: no structured C1).
//
// Check after proofs/mallocng_c1_cfg.core and the C2 proofs.

refines gst_ref c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc_cfg.get_stride_fun c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.get_stride_fun
refines a_ctz_32_ref c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc_cfg.a_ctz_32_fun c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.a_ctz_32_fun
